      <p><strong>Dashboard:</strong> leadership KPIs, monthly revenue trend and concise executive commentary.</p>
      <p><strong>Financial-model convention:</strong> hardcoded assumptions are blue, formulas are black and links from other worksheets are green.</p>
    </div>
